y software that enables autonomous navigation in unstructured GPS-denied environments; and ExynView, a software suite to plan and execute autonomous missions, view real-time point cloud data, and post-process that data into actionable 3D digital models. Its products also comprise Exyn Nexys, a modular 3D mapping solution to reduce time to capture data, increase safety, and drive efficiency. The company serves mining, construction, energy, geospatial, critical infrastructure inspection, and defense industries. Exyn Technologies, Inc. was incorporated in 2014 and is based in Philadelphia, Pennsylvania."}}